From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath10k: allow VHT capabilities on 2.4 GHz

Allow the 2.4 GHz band to advertise VHT capabilities for firmware that
supports this operating mode.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/mac.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/mac.c
@@ -5063,6 +5063,7 @@ static void ath10k_mac_setup_ht_vht_cap(
 	if (ar->phy_capability & WHAL_WLAN_11G_CAPABILITY) {
 		band = &ar->mac.sbands[NL80211_BAND_2GHZ];
 		band->ht_cap = ht_cap;
+		band->vht_cap = vht_cap;
 	}
 	if (ar->phy_capability & WHAL_WLAN_11A_CAPABILITY) {
 		band = &ar->mac.sbands[NL80211_BAND_5GHZ];
